Portions of rules/comments/comments.go are derived from comment-checker's src/filters.rs
and src/output.rs, used under the MIT License. Specifically:

  - bddKeywords          <- BDD_KEYWORDS
  - directivePrefixes    <- DIRECTIVE_PREFIXES
  - memoPrefixes         <- is_english_agent_memo vocabulary (restructured)
  - hasBareArrow         <- has_ascii_arrow heuristic
  - isBDD, isDirective   <- BddFilter, DirectiveFilter
  - stripMarkers         <- strip_one_prefix, strip_agent_prefixes
  - commentGuidance      <- the remediation prompt's priority structure

rules/comments/scan.go, the touched-comment diffing, and the configurable thresholds
are independent work and are not derived from comment-checker.

